[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 14882.07, "timestamp": "04:08:02", "text": "说你错了。我不是我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14884.63, "timestamp": "04:08:04", "text": "只是说这不是个好方法"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14887.51, "timestamp": "04:08:07", "text": "这个地方。你说得对，但这是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14889.75, "timestamp": "04:08:09", "text": "但这并非处理这种情况的最佳方法。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14892.229, "timestamp": "04:08:12", "text": "地方。然后你就会平静下来，就像这样："}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14894.79, "timestamp": "04:08:14", "text": "“哦，是的，他说我是对的。”好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14897.269, "timestamp": "04:08:17", "text": "好的。好的。我正在听。你是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14899.429, "timestamp": "04:08:19", "text": "正在听。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14901.349, "timestamp": "04:08:21", "text": "如果我说你错了，那你就错了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14903.75, "timestamp": "04:08:23", "text": "正在听。你永远不会听。是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14905.67, "timestamp": "04:08:25", "text": "兄弟。你不。你会像这样，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14908.91, "timestamp": "04:08:28", "text": "“你不是维克。你根本没在听。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14912.07, "timestamp": "04:08:32", "text": "我。如果你说你很长，你就是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14915.03, "timestamp": "04:08:35", "text": "长的。而现在有趣的是，两者"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14917.99, "timestamp": "04:08:37", "text": "我们很长。没人听。我们将"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14920.07, "timestamp": "04:08:40", "text": "我们只会互相吼叫，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14922.309, "timestamp": "04:08:42", "text": "这件事不会结束。我们俩都会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14926.15, "timestamp": "04:08:46", "text": "双方始终意见不合。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14928.79, "timestamp": "04:08:48", "text": "所以有时候，是的，显然，无论你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14930.95, "timestamp": "04:08:50", "text": "显然他说的肯定是对的，但是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14934.07, "timestamp": "04:08:54", "text": "不是那种“呃，让我想想，我这就走”的情况。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14939.03, "timestamp": "04:08:59", "text": "好的，你，你是说我们，我们"}]